<title>NEW ZEALAND: Sky City 5 month profit NZ$15.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Sky City 5 month profit NZ$15.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five months to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 15.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 15.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 15.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				    82.7 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     15.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Tax					    nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 100.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note - Sky City Ltd operates a casino in Auckland and is half owned by Brierley Investments Ltd. It is in its maiden year. It said the dividend would be paid in December but did not provide further details.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
